1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,112
Let's be honest.

2
00:00:01,162 --> 00:00:04,363
You probably have thousands of photos sitting in one big folder,

3
00:00:04,413 --> 00:00:07,156
and you keep telling yourself you'll sort them someday.

4
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:12,287
Doing it by hand means dragging every single photo into the right folder,

5
00:00:12,337 --> 00:00:15,434
scrolling down, and doing it all over again, for hours.

6
00:00:17,159 --> 00:00:21,134
That's exactly why I built SlimSort, the fastest way to sort your photos.

7
00:00:22,129 --> 00:00:25,652
You just pick the folder with your photos, create a few target folders,

8
00:00:25,702 --> 00:00:27,363
and each of them gets its own key.

9
00:00:29,629 --> 00:00:33,159
Then you simply press a key, and the photo moves into that folder.

10
00:00:33,209 --> 00:00:36,792
One for family, two for holiday, and space if you want to skip one.

11
00:00:36,842 --> 00:00:39,070
The next photo is already waiting for you.

12
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:42,623
Once you get into the rhythm, it gets really fast.

13
00:00:42,673 --> 00:00:45,746
You can sort about a thousand photos in roughly ten minutes.

14
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:49,427
And you don't have to worry about losing anything.

15
00:00:49,477 --> 00:00:52,373
Every step can be undone, files are never overwritten,

16
00:00:52,423 --> 00:00:56,684
and if your network drive goes offline, your photos simply stay where they are.

17
00:00:57,679 --> 00:01:01,745
If you took ten shots of the same moment, SlimSort finds that series for you,

18
00:01:01,795 --> 00:01:05,006
shows the photos side by side, and suggests the sharpest one.

19
00:01:05,056 --> 00:01:07,999
You keep your favorite and clear out the rest in one go.

20
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:12,940
There's also an overview mode, support for multiple folders,

21
00:01:12,990 --> 00:01:15,478
a light and a dark design, and five languages.

22
00:01:15,528 --> 00:01:18,678
It's simple when you start, and powerful when you need it.

23
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:22,290
And the best part is that it's completely free.

24
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:24,725
There are no ads, no account, and no cloud,

25
00:01:24,775 --> 00:01:27,046
so your photos never leave your computer.

26
00:01:28,050 --> 00:01:31,788
SlimSort is available for Windows and Mac, and you can download it for free.

27
00:01:31,838 --> 00:01:33,782
You'll find the link in the description.
